th 1,200 credits. Ultra is $99 a month billed annually or $129 billed monthly with 3,000 credits. Team plans start at $65 per seat per month. Prices exclude VAT."}, {"q": "Is Higgsfield really unlimited?", "a": "Only partly. Plus and Ultra include 7-day unlimited windows on selected models such as Kling 3.0 and Nano Banana 2. These apply only on higgsfield.ai, not via MCP, CLI, Canvas or Supercomputer, and speed can be reduced during high traffic. Everything else uses credits."}, {"q": "How big is Higgsfield?", "a": "In September 2026 Higgsfield said it had passed a $1 billion annualized revenue run rate, calculated as four weeks of revenue times 13, with more than 32 million users and nearly 1 million paying subscribers. These are the company's own, unaudited figures."}]$t$::jsonb, NULL, ARRAY[$t$kling-ai$t$, $t$runway$t$, $t$krea-ai$t$]::text[], false, $t$2026-10-25$t$::date)
