mails, integrations, MCP and API access. Enterprise costs $35 per user per month."}, {"q": "Does Granola use a meeting bot?", "a": "No. Granola records audio from your own device, so no bot appears in the call. That also means other participants are not automatically notified, so you should tell them you are taking AI notes. An organization-wide notification is available as a pilot on Enterprise."}, {"q": "Which platforms does Granola support?", "a": "Granola has apps for macOS, Windows, iOS and Android, plus an Apple Watch app launched in July 2026. It also connects to AI tools such as Claude, ChatGPT and Cursor through its MCP connector."}]$t$::jsonb, NULL, ARRAY[$t$otter-ai$t$, $t$fireflies-ai$t$, $t$notion-ai$t$]::text[], false, $t$2026-10-25$t$::date)
