ts you create reports for your own use. Power BI Pro costs $14 per user per month paid yearly and is included in Microsoft 365 E5. Premium Per User costs $24 per user per month paid yearly. Fabric capacity is priced pay-as-you-go or by yearly reservation."}, {"q": "Is Copilot included in Power BI Pro?", "a": "No. Copilot in Power BI requires the report or workspace to be on a paid Microsoft Fabric capacity of F2 or higher or Power BI Premium P1 or higher. A Pro or Premium Per User license alone is not enough, and trial capacities are not supported."}, {"q": "What can Copilot do in Power BI?", "a": "Copilot can answer questions about your data, summarize reports, find reports and models, create and edit report pages, add narrative visuals, write DAX queries and suggest improvements to semantic models. The report Copilot pane is generally available; the standalone agent and some other experiences are in preview."}]$t$::jsonb, NULL, ARRAY[$t$tableau-ai$t$, $t$looker-studio$t$, $t$julius-ai$t$]::text[], false, $t$2026-10-25$t$::date)
