are shown in local currency and vary by region."}, {"q": "Which AI models does Magnific include?", "a": "Magnific offers 30+ models, including Kling, Seedance, Google Veo, Nano Banana 2 and Nano Banana Pro, FLUX.2, Recraft and Ideogram, plus its own Magnific One image model and music models such as Google Lyria 3 and ElevenLabs."}, {"q": "What does unlimited mean on Magnific?", "a": "Premium+ and Pro include unlimited generation on most image models and some video models. Some premium models and all video, audio and editing tools still consume credits, and speed can be limited during busy periods."}]$t$::jsonb, NULL, ARRAY[$t$krea-ai$t$, $t$adobe-firefly$t$, $t$leonardo-ai$t$]::text[], false, $t$2026-10-25$t$::date)
